; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 1: The Candy Calculator
; Language: Greenlandic / Kalaallisut (kl)
; ==========================================
; 1. You start with 7 candies. Put 7 in 'box'.
; 2. Your best friend gives you 8 more candies. Add 8!
; 3. You share 4 candies with your sibling. Take away 4!
; 4. Show the result on screen using 'atortup_qaaqqussutaa'!

nussorpaa box 7
